{
  "name": "Read weekly report",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Read weekly report (Lab 8)\nGET `/webhook/lab8-weekly-report?weekStart=YYYY-MM-DD` → `{ report }` из таблицы **lab72_weekly_stats**, или `{ report: null }`.\nGET `/webhook/lab8-weekly-history` → `{ reports: [{ weekStart, totals }] }` — все сохранённые недели, новые сверху.\nЗащита: в обоих Webhook выбери Authentication → Header Auth (`Authorization: Bearer <токен>`), тот же токен — в `N8N_WEBHOOK_TOKEN` на Vercel.",
        "width": 980,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -220
      ],
      "id": "4583b851-f8db-47f9-b816-7560421ed8c0",
      "name": "About"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "lab8-weekly-report",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "f6658aef-6331-441d-97e5-3d1ead77f803",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "webhookId": "51be0823-5fc9-4185-94f2-6b4b8421fd0b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const weekStart = String($json.query?.weekStart ?? '').trim();\nconst match = /^(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})$/.exec(weekStart);\nlet valid = false;\nif (match) {\n  const [, y, m, d] = match.map(Number);\n  const date = new Date(Date.UTC(y, m - 1, d));\n  valid = date.getUTCFullYear() === y && date.getUTCMonth() === m - 1 &&\n    date.getUTCDate() === d && date.getUTCDay() === 1;\n}\nreturn [{ json: { repository: 'tarasxryak/cs-math', weekStart, valid } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "id": "17de34fe-3673-4381-91f9-098b42f4043b",
      "name": "Validate weekStart"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "fe06b955-e662-4885-93a4-2a19b6d156f1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "id": "dd5c3a6a-3694-47ae-9f7e-4095067ea591",
      "name": "Is a Monday?"
    },
